  "anima_batch": {
    "description": "Generate 2..16 separate frames sequentially on GPU, then optionally assemble. One mode per batch. Each frame inherits defaults/references and may override ALL generation options and references independently. Use per-frame strength/seed/CFG/windows for comparisons. Stable request_id; generation_status advances the persisted batch. No background delivery promise. Read drawer-images.",
